```http
### ============================================
### 1. Login successfully (expect 200)
### ============================================
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=johndoe&password=secret

> {% client.global.set("access_token", response.body.access_token); %}

### ============================================
### 2. Get current user (expect 200)
### ============================================
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/users/me/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### ============================================
### 3. Get current user's items (expect 200)
### ============================================
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/users/me/items/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### ============================================
### 4. Login with incorrect password (expect 401)
### ============================================
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=johndoe&password=wrong

### ============================================
### 5. Access without a token (expect 401)
### ============================================
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/users/me/

### ============================================
### 6. Access with an invalid token (expect 401)
### ============================================
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/users/me/
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token
```